    "text": "Omg this was seriously delicious \\ud83e\\udd24 \n\nIt’s a fully plant based cafe in Berlin, came highly recommended (by chatgpt \\ud83d\\ude44) and it did not disappoint. My favorite had to be the white chocolate \\u0026 apple coffee cake (I took 3 different ones for to go to try them out). The most moist plant based coffee cake I've ever tasted. I am going back again just for it. But everything was super delicious. And the best part no exploitation of animals was done. Because why would I choose otherwise? The cafe is super cute. 10 out of 10. Thanks chatgpt \\ud83d\\ude01\n\n#vegan #plantbased #berlin #travel #food ",
